%%pofu island home
%%pofu time day
%%pofu order A A2 B END
% The gentle one, a little slower. It starts from the top and falls, like
% petals: F# D B, a turn, a breath; then lower; and the motif is the answer,
% rising from the bottom in the third bar. The middle (B) leans on C# and
% climbs to the highest note of the tune. The keys walk a slow broken chord
% under it, a note a beat, and there is no tok.
P:A
